// ------------------------------------------------------------
// Role member sign-in activity (Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting)
//
// Summarizes successful Entra ID sign-ins for a list of users by
// application and resource. Run 01-Get-EntraRoleMembership.ps1 to
// generate a copy of this query with the RoleMembers list populated,
// or paste UPNs in manually.
//
// Notes:
//   - Advanced Hunting typically retains ~30 days of data. Larger
//     lookbacks return only what is available.
//   - EntraIdSignInEvents requires Entra ID P2. Older tenants may
//     expose the same data as AADSignInEventsBeta.
//   - Export results as CSV for 03-Merge-RoleUsage.ps1.
// ------------------------------------------------------------
let Lookback = 30d;
let RoleMembers = dynamic([
    "user1@contoso.com",
    "user2@contoso.com"
]);
EntraIdSignInEvents
| where Timestamp >= ago(Lookback)
| where AccountUpn in~ (RoleMembers)
| where ErrorCode == 0
| summarize
    SignIns = count(),
    ActiveDays = dcount(startofday(Timestamp)),
    FirstSeen = min(Timestamp),
    LastSeen = max(Timestamp)
    by AccountDisplayName,
       AccountUpn,
       Application,
       ApplicationId,
       ResourceDisplayName
| order by AccountDisplayName asc, SignIns desc
